WEBVTT

00:13:59.204 --> 00:14:01.162
I'm stressed as the most
common one, I hear.

00:14:01.871 --> 00:14:05.996
But there's a world of difference between
stress and disappointment or stress,

00:14:05.996 --> 00:14:08.996
and that knowing dread of
I'm in the wrong career,

00:14:10.204 --> 00:14:12.079
when we label our emotions accurately,

00:14:12.079 --> 00:14:15.329
we are more able to discern the
precise cause of our feelings

00:14:16.037 --> 00:14:17.912
and what scientists call the readiness.

00:14:17.912 --> 00:14:22.246
Potential in our brain is activated,
allowing us to take concrete steps,

00:14:22.871 --> 00:14:27.829
but not just any steps, the right steps
for us, because our emotions are data.

00:14:28.454 --> 00:14:32.204
Our emotions contain flashing lights
to things that we care about.